Package: com.mbucc9000.cameraflip
Name: CameraFlip
Version: 2.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Snapchat-style camera flip for the Camera app: double-tap the preview to switch between the back and front cameras, for photos and videos. While recording it flips without stopping: one continuous video, and the mic runs separately so audio keeps going through the flip.
Author: mbucc9000
Maintainer: mbucc9000
